CERTORA VERIFICATION MUNGE — route BaseMigrationMixin's result-mapping read through getResult()
===============================================================================================
Split out of NegRiskModule_getResult.patch so BaseMigrationMixin munges can be
excluded selectively (e.g. whole-function migrate experiments on pristine code).
Redirects the single `result[conditionId]` read in _redeemIfResolved to the
virtual `getResult(conditionId)` view, so the CVL summary of `getResult`
governs it; same rationale as the parent patch.

Required by: NegRiskModule solvency + sanity scenes (ghost-modeled results).
Apply:  git apply certora/patches/BaseMigrationMixin_getResult.patch
Revert: git apply -R certora/patches/BaseMigrationMixin_getResult.patch
Never commit the applied state to src/.

